# Frame budget: a fight by a factory (GODMODE keeps it going): turrets' flak,
# jets, boats, bombs and explosions, the scroller. The average is 45-55%; the
# worst game frame (~87%) is a bomb landing on a factory: the blast, the
# factory's tiles, the fireball and new flak in one picture; the switch from
# the title to the game reaches ~93% for a picture or two. None is dropped.
wait-serial "AGK t0"
wait 10
press fire 2
wait-serial "theatre loaded=0"
wait 10
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x0A
wait 30
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x09
wait 20
checkpoint fight
press fire2 2
wait 30
press fire 1
wait 10
press fire 1
wait 600
press left+up 120
wait 300
expect-no-dropped-frames
expect-max-load 95
expect-min-chip-free 64
